# Real Estate Price Predictor

Random Forest regression model predicting property prices across three 
Melbourne suburbs — Highton, Carnegie, and Brighton East.
Includes an interactive Streamlit dashboard for model exploration.

## Key Result
R² of 0.72 on 1,600+ manually collected real estate records.

## Features
- Data collected manually from real listings across three suburbs
- Random Forest model with hyperparameter tuning
- Interactive Streamlit dashboard for price prediction

## Tech
Python, scikit-learn, pandas, Matplotlib, Streamlit

